        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intento %1$lld: %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attempts not counted": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intentos no contados"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bearing": {
      "comment": "needs_review",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Bearing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bearing could not open its saved data. Restart the app. If this keeps happening, delete and reinstall it.": {
      "comment": "needs_review",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Bearing no pudo abrir sus datos guardados. Reinicie la app. Si esto sigue pasando, bórrela y vuelva a instalarla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bearing measures how you move, using your phone camera.": {
      "comment": "needs_review",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Bearing mide cómo se mueve usted, con la cámara de su teléfono."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bearing movement report": {
      "comment": "needs_review",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Informe de movimiento de Bearing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bearing movement summary": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resumen de movimiento de Bearing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bearing needs the camera to measure your movement. Video stays on your phone and is never saved.": {
      "comment": "needs_review",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Bearing necesita la cámara para medir su movimiento. El video se queda en su teléfono y nunca se guarda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bearing needs your permission to show a reminder at the times you pick. Reminders stay on your phone.": {
      "comment": "needs_review",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Bearing necesita su permiso para mostrar un recordatorio a las horas que usted elija. Los recordatorios se quedan en su teléfono."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bearing uses the camera to measure movement on this phone. Video is never saved or sent anywhere.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bearing usa la cámara para medir movimiento en este teléfono. Nunca se guarda ni se envía video."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bearing uses the camera to measure your arm movement on this phone. Video is never saved or sent anywhere.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bearing usa la cámara para medir el movimiento de su brazo en este teléfono. El video nunca se guarda ni se envía."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bearing works offline. It has no accounts and does not save video.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bearing funciona sin internet. No tiene cuentas ni guarda video."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before each attempt": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antes de cada intento"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before you start": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antes de empezar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before you start. Ask them to stand next to a stable support. Stay within arm's reach. Stop if they feel dizzy, have pain, or feel unsteady.": {
      "comment": "needs_review",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Antes de comenzar. Pídale que se pare junto a un soporte estable. Manténgase al alcance de su brazo. Deténgase si siente mareo, dolor o inestabilidad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before you start. Stand next to a stable support. Keep a person within arm's reach. Stop if you feel dizzy, have pain, or feel unsteady.": {
      "comment": "needs_review",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Antes de comenzar. Párese junto a un soporte estable. Tenga a una persona al alcance de su brazo. Deténgase si siente mareo, dolor o inestabilidad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bend your knee as comfortable, then return to your starting position.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doble la rodilla hasta donde se sienta cómodo. Luego vuelva a la posición inicial."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bold skeleton": {
      "comment": "needs_review",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Esqueleto grueso"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bold skeleton makes the lines on the camera view thicker. Easy Start lets a helper tap Start instead of pressing and holding it.": {
      "comment": "needs_review",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "El esqueleto grueso hace más gruesas las líneas de la vista de la cámara. El inicio fácil permite que un ayudante toque Comenzar en lugar de mantenerlo presionado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Building your starting point: %lld of %lld sessions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Creando su punto de partida: %1$lld de %2$lld sesiones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Camera access is off": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El acceso a la cámara está apagado"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Camera counts and hold estimates depend on framing and joint tracking. They do not describe your health.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los conteos y tiempos estimados dependen del encuadre y del seguimiento de articulaciones. No describen su salud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Camera pictures stay in memory while Bearing measures movement. The app saves no images or video.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las imágenes quedan en la memoria mientras Bearing mide el movimiento. La app no guarda imágenes ni video."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Camera tracking checks stay fixed for this routine.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las comprobaciones de la cámara se mantienen fijas para esta rutina."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Camera view": {
      "comment": "needs_review",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Vista de la cámara"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "comment": "needs_review",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cancelar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Caregiver mode": {
      "comment": "needs_review",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Modo de cuidador"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Caregiver mode uses the back camera so someone else can hold the phone. The countdown gives you time to get into position after you tap Start.": {
      "comment": "needs_review",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "El modo de cuidador usa la cámara trasera para que otra persona sostenga el teléfono. La cuenta regresiva le da tiempo para ponerse en posición después de tocar Comenzar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes could not be saved": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se pudieron guardar los cambios"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check-in name": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nombre del registro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check-ins": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Registros"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check-ins this week": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Registros de esta semana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check-ins this week: %lld of %lld": {
      "comment": "needs_review",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Registros esta semana: %1$lld de %2$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a routine": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elija una rutina"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a side": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elija un lado"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a supported routine or record a timer or count yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elija una rutina disponible o registre el tiempo o las repeticiones por su cuenta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose an arm": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elija un brazo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose routines you already follow. This is your personal plan.": {
      "localizations": {
